{"seq":2,"slug":"reconnect-recovery","title":"断线重连：重连 Token、快照恢复与 Backfill 补位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/engineering/reconnect-recovery","wordCount":1039,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"断线重连-重连-token-快照恢复与-backfill-补位\">断线重连：重连 Token、快照恢复与 Backfill 补位</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>重连 Token</strong></td>\n<td>断线时生成的一次性短期凭证（32 字节随机值），有效期 = 宽限期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宽限期（Grace Period）</strong></td>\n<td>断线后保留玩家大厅状态的等待窗口（通常 30~60 秒）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预分发 Token</strong></td>\n<td>在连接正常时每 30 秒预先推送重连 Token，避免断线时无法获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>快照版本号</strong></td>\n<td>单调递增，记录断线时的房间快照版本，重连后补发增量事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Backfill</strong></td>\n<td>对局中参与玩家断线且宽限期内未重连时，补充等待玩家填入空位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BackfillRequest</strong></td>\n<td>大厅向匹配系统发起的补位请求，携带空位队伍信息和 MMR 约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"断线是常态-不是异常\">断线是常态，不是异常</h2><p>网络不稳定（移动端网络切换、WiFi 信号弱、代理超时）是多人游戏玩家的日常体验。一个健壮的大厅系统必须将断线重连设计为<strong>一等功能</strong>，而不是事后补丁。</p>\n<p>设计断线重连的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>断线后玩家的大厅状态应该保留一段宽限期（通常 30~60 秒）</li>\n<li>重连成功后，玩家恢复到断线前的状态（无缝）</li>\n<li>宽限期内其他玩家收到断线通知，但不立即踢出（UI 显示&quot;连接中...&quot;）</li>\n<li>宽限期结束后仍未重连，才清理状态，通知其他玩家该玩家已离开</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"重连-token-设计\">重连 Token 设计</h2><p>重连 Token 是一个短期有效的凭证，允许玩家在断线后使用同一身份恢复到之前的大厅状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与普通-session-token-的区别\">与普通 Session Token 的区别</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>Session Token</th>\n<th>重连 Token</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有效期</td>\n<td>会话存续期间</td>\n<td>30~60 秒（宽限期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用次数</td>\n<td>多次</td>\n<td>一次（使用后立即废弃）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>携带信息</td>\n<td>玩家身份</td>\n<td>玩家身份 + 房间快照引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储位置</td>\n<td>Redis（长期）</td>\n<td>Redis（短 TTL）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"重连-token-的生成\">重连 Token 的生成</h3><p>当服务端检测到 WebSocket 连接断开时（Heart beat 超时或收到 TCP RST），立即生成重连 Token 并存入 Redis：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type ReconnectToken struct {&#10;    Token          string    // 32 字节随机值，Base62 编码&#10;    PlayerID       string&#10;    RoomID         string&#10;    SnapshotVersion int64    // 玩家离开时的快照版本号&#10;    CreatedAt      time.Time&#10;    ExpiresAt      time.Time // 宽限期结束时间&#10;    IsUsed         bool      // 使用后标记，防止重放&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (r *RoomActor) onPlayerDisconnected(playerID string) {&#10;    player := r.players[playerID]&#10;&#10;    // 生成重连 Token&#10;    token := ReconnectToken{&#10;        Token:           generateSecureToken(32),&#10;        PlayerID:        playerID,&#10;        RoomID:          r.id,&#10;        SnapshotVersion: r.snapshotVersion,&#10;        CreatedAt:       time.Now(),&#10;        ExpiresAt:       time.Now().Add(ReconnectGracePeriod),&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 存入 Redis&#10;    r.store.SaveReconnectToken(token)&#10;&#10;    // 更新玩家状态为 DISCONNECTED（但不从房间移除）&#10;    player.ConnectionStatus = StatusDisconnected&#10;    player.DisconnectedAt = time.Now()&#10;    player.ReconnectToken = token.Token&#10;&#10;    // 广播断线通知（其他玩家看到，不强制开始踢出倒计时）&#10;    r.broadcast(PlayerDisconnectedEvent{&#10;        PlayerID:      playerID,&#10;        GracePeriodSec: int(ReconnectGracePeriod.Seconds()),&#10;    })&#10;&#10;    // 启动宽限期计时器&#10;    r.scheduleTimeout(ReconnectGracePeriod, TimeoutActionKickDisconnectedPlayer(playerID))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Token          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 32 字节随机值，Base62 编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PlayerID       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RoomID         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SnapshotVersion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int64</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 玩家离开时的快照版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CreatedAt      </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ExpiresAt      </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 宽限期结束时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IsUsed         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 使用后标记，防止重放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onPlayerDisconnected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.players[playerID]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 生成重连 Token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Token:           </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generateSecureToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PlayerID:        playerID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        RoomID:          r.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        SnapshotVersion: r.snapshotVersion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        CreatedAt:       time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ExpiresAt:       time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ReconnectGracePeriod),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 存入 Redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SaveReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 更新玩家状态为 DISCONNECTED（但不从房间移除）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player.ConnectionStatus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StatusDisconnected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player.DisconnectedAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    player.ReconnectToken </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token.Token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 广播断线通知（其他玩家看到，不强制开始踢出倒计时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PlayerDisconnectedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PlayerID:      playerID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        GracePeriodSec: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ReconnectGracePeriod.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Seconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 启动宽限期计时器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">scheduleTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ReconnectGracePeriod, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TimeoutActionKickDisconnectedPlayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"重连-token-发给客户端\">重连 Token 发给客户端</h3><p>重连 Token 需要在连接断开<strong>之前</strong>发给客户端。常见做法：在正常会话期间，服务端定期（每 30 秒）向客户端推送预生成的重连 Token，客户端持久化到本地存储。断线时，客户端用最后收到的有效 Token 重连。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 服务端定期推送重连 Token（非断线触发，而是预分发）&#10;func (r *RoomActor) refreshReconnectTokens() {&#10;    for playerID := range r.players {&#10;        token := generateReconnectToken(playerID, r.id)&#10;        r.store.SaveReconnectToken(token)&#10;        r.sendToPlayer(playerID, ReconnectTokenRefreshEvent{&#10;            Token:     token.Token,&#10;            ExpiresAt: token.ExpiresAt,&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端定期推送重连 Token（非断线触发，而是预分发）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refreshReconnectTokens</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> playerID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.players {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID, r.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SaveReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendToPlayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReconnectTokenRefreshEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Token:     token.Token,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ExpiresAt: token.ExpiresAt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"断线检测流程\">断线检测流程</h2><p>断线检测通过多层机制协作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"WebSocket 连接异常关闭（TCP RST）&#10;    → 立即触发 onPlayerDisconnected&#10;&#10;WebSocket 应用层心跳超时（45 秒无 Pong）&#10;    → 服务端主动关闭连接 → 触发 onPlayerDisconnected&#10;&#10;服务端 Goroutine 检测（兜底，每 60 秒扫描）&#10;    → 检查 LastHeartbeat &gt; 90 秒的连接 → 强制断线\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>WebSocket 连接异常关闭（TCP RST）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 立即触发 onPlayerDisconnected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WebSocket 应用层心跳超时（45 秒无 Pong）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 服务端主动关闭连接 → 触发 onPlayerDisconnected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>服务端 Goroutine 检测（兜底，每 60 秒扫描）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 检查 LastHeartbeat > 90 秒的连接 → 强制断线</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三层检测确保断线不会被漏检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态快照恢复流程\">状态快照恢复流程</h2><p>玩家携带重连 Token 重新建立 WebSocket 连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (ls *LobbyServer) handleReconnect(token, playerID string) error {&#10;    // 1. 验证 Token&#10;    reconnectToken, err := ls.store.GetReconnectToken(token)&#10;    if err != nil || reconnectToken.IsUsed {&#10;        return ErrInvalidReconnectToken&#10;    }&#10;    if time.Now().After(reconnectToken.ExpiresAt) {&#10;        return ErrReconnectTokenExpired&#10;    }&#10;    if reconnectToken.PlayerID != playerID {&#10;        return ErrReconnectTokenPlayerMismatch&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 2. 立即标记 Token 为已使用（防止重放攻击）&#10;    ls.store.MarkTokenUsed(token)&#10;&#10;    // 3. 取消宽限期超时计时器&#10;    room := ls.getRoom(reconnectToken.RoomID)&#10;    if room == nil {&#10;        return ErrRoomNotFound // 宽限期内房间被解散&#10;    }&#10;    room.cancelDisconnectTimeout(playerID)&#10;&#10;    // 4. 更新玩家状态为 RECONNECTED&#10;    room.players[playerID].ConnectionStatus = StatusActive&#10;    room.players[playerID].Conn = newConn // 替换新 WebSocket 连接&#10;&#10;    // 5. 发送当前房间状态快照（玩家断线期间可能有状态变化）&#10;    snapshot := room.getSnapshot()&#10;    newConn.WriteJSON(RoomStateRestoredEvent{&#10;        Snapshot:         snapshot,&#10;        MissedEventsSince: reconnectToken.SnapshotVersion,&#10;    })&#10;&#10;    // 6. 广播重连通知给其他玩家&#10;    room.broadcast(PlayerReconnectedEvent{PlayerID: playerID})&#10;&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleReconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 1. 验证 Token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reconnectToken, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetReconnectToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reconnectToken.IsUsed {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrInvalidReconnectToken</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reconnectToken.ExpiresAt) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrReconnectTokenExpired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reconnectToken.PlayerID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> playerID {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrReconnectTokenPlayerMismatch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 2. 立即标记 Token 为已使用（防止重放攻击）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ls.store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MarkTokenUsed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 3. 取消宽限期超时计时器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getRoom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reconnectToken.RoomID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> room </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrRoomNotFound </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 宽限期内房间被解散</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancelDisconnectTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 4. 更新玩家状态为 RECONNECTED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room.players[playerID].ConnectionStatus </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StatusActive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room.players[playerID].Conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newConn </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 替换新 WebSocket 连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 5. 发送当前房间状态快照（玩家断线期间可能有状态变化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    snapshot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    newConn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteJSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomStateRestoredEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Snapshot:         snapshot,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MissedEventsSince: reconnectToken.SnapshotVersion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 6. 广播重连通知给其他玩家</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PlayerReconnectedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{PlayerID: playerID})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"增量事件回放\">增量事件回放</h3><p>如果断线期间有事件（其他玩家加入/离开、房间属性变更），在快照基础上追加增量事件，避免重连后状态不一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type RoomStateRestoredEvent struct {&#10;    Snapshot          RoomSnapshot    // 当前完整状态&#10;    MissedEventsSince int64           // 从这个版本号之后的事件&#10;    MissedEvents      []RoomEvent     // 断线期间发生的事件列表&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 服务端构造增量事件列表&#10;func (r *RoomActor) getMissedEvents(sinceVersion int64) []RoomEvent {&#10;    return r.eventLog.GetAfterVersion(sinceVersion)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoomStateRestoredEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Snapshot          </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomSnapshot</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 当前完整状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MissedEventsSince </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int64</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 从这个版本号之后的事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MissedEvents      []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomEvent</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 断线期间发生的事件列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端构造增量事件列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getMissedEvents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sinceVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.eventLog.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetAfterVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sinceVersion)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"backfill-补位\">Backfill 补位</h2><p>Backfill（回填）指在游戏已开始后，将等待中的玩家填入因断线而空出的参与位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"使用场景\">使用场景</h3><ul>\n<li>玩家在游戏开始后断线，且宽限期内未重连</li>\n<li>游戏模式允许延迟加入（<code>allow_late_join: true</code>）</li>\n<li>队列中有等待观战或等待加入的玩家</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"backfill-流程\">Backfill 流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (ls *LobbyService) triggerBackfill(room *Room, emptyPlayerSlot int) {&#10;    if !room.lateJoinPolicy.AllowedForPlayers {&#10;        return // 不允许延迟加入&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 通知匹配系统：有空位，需要补充玩家&#10;    backfillRequest := BackfillRequest{&#10;        MatchID:   room.MatchID,&#10;        EmptySlot: emptyPlayerSlot,&#10;        TeamID:    room.getTeamForSlot(emptyPlayerSlot),&#10;        Constraints: BackfillConstraints{&#10;            Region:    room.Region,&#10;            GameMode:  room.GameMode,&#10;            MinMMR:    room.AverageMMR * 0.8,  // 接近当前平均水平&#10;            MaxMMR:    room.AverageMMR * 1.2,&#10;        },&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    ls.matchmakerClient.RequestBackfill(backfillRequest)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 匹配系统找到合适玩家后回调&#10;func (ls *LobbyService) onBackfillAssigned(matchID, playerID string, slot int) {&#10;    room := ls.getRoomByMatchID(matchID)&#10;    // 通知新玩家立即连接游戏服务器（延迟加入）&#10;    ls.notifyLateJoin(playerID, room.ServerAddress, room.JoinToken, slot)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">triggerBackfill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">room</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Room</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">emptyPlayerSlot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">room.lateJoinPolicy.AllowedForPlayers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 不允许延迟加入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 通知匹配系统：有空位，需要补充玩家</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backfillRequest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BackfillRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MatchID:   room.MatchID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        EmptySlot: emptyPlayerSlot,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        TeamID:    room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTeamForSlot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(emptyPlayerSlot),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Constraints: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BackfillConstraints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Region:    room.Region,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            GameMode:  room.GameMode,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            MinMMR:    room.AverageMMR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 接近当前平均水平</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            MaxMMR:    room.AverageMMR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ls.matchmakerClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RequestBackfill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(backfillRequest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 匹配系统找到合适玩家后回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LobbyService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBackfillAssigned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">matchID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">slot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getRoomByMatchID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(matchID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 通知新玩家立即连接游戏服务器（延迟加入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">notifyLateJoin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID, room.ServerAddress, room.JoinToken, slot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Backfill 的关键约束：补充的玩家 MMR 应接近当前对局水平（避免打破对局平衡），且游戏服务器需要支持运行时接受新连接（在其自身的延迟加入窗口内）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断线重连完整流程图\">断线重连完整流程图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 玩家客户端&#10;    participant LS as Lobby Server&#10;    participant R as Redis&#10;&#10;    Note over C,LS: 正常运行阶段(每30秒预分发)&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;C: ReconnectTokenRefresh {token, expires_at}&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: 持久化 token 到本地存储&#10;&#10;    Note over C,LS: 断线发生&#10;    C--xLS: WebSocket 连接中断&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: onPlayerDisconnected → 标记 DISCONNECTED&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: SETEX reconnect:{token} 60s ReconnectToken&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 启动宽限期计时器 60s&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;C: 广播 PlayerDisconnectedEvent (grace=60s)&#10;&#10;    Note over C,LS: 重连阶段&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;LS: WebSocket 重连 ?reconnect_token={token}&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: GET reconnect:{token} → 验证&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;R: 标记 Token 已使用&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 取消宽限期计时器&#10;    LS--&gt;&gt;C: RoomStateRestoredEvent {snapshot, missed_events}&#10;    LS-&gt;&gt;C: 广播 PlayerReconnectedEvent\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 玩家客户端\n    participant LS as Lobby Server\n    participant R as Redis\n\n    Note over C,LS: 正常运行阶段(每30秒预分发)\n    LS-&gt;&gt;C: ReconnectTokenRefresh {token, expires_at}\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: 持久化 token 到本地存储\n\n    Note over C,LS: 断线发生\n    C--xLS: WebSocket 连接中断\n    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: onPlayerDisconnected → 标记 DISCONNECTED\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: SETEX reconnect:{token} 60s ReconnectToken\n    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 启动宽限期计时器 60s\n    LS-&gt;&gt;C: 广播 PlayerDisconnectedEvent (grace=60s)\n\n    Note over C,LS: 重连阶段\n    C-&gt;&gt;LS: WebSocket 重连 ?reconnect_token={token}\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: GET reconnect:{token} → 验证\n    LS-&gt;&gt;R: 标记 Token 已使用\n    LS-&gt;&gt;LS: 取消宽限期计时器\n    LS--&gt;&gt;C: RoomStateRestoredEvent {snapshot, missed_events}\n    LS-&gt;&gt;C: 广播 PlayerReconnectedEvent</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>断线重连的核心设计是<strong>预分发 Token + 宽限期保留</strong>：不在断线发生后才生成 Token（断线后无法传达），而是在连接正常时每 30 秒预推送；断线后保留玩家的大厅状态 60 秒（宽限期），这段时间内重连可以无缝恢复。重连恢复通过快照+增量事件补发，确保断线期间的状态变化不遗漏。Token 是一次性的，防止重放攻击。Backfill 机制作为断线未恢复的最终处理，保证对局不因一名玩家永久缺席而陷入不公平，其 MMR 约束确保补充玩家的水平与现有队伍匹配。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"断线重连：重连 Token、快照恢复与 Backfill 补位","id":"断线重连-重连-token-快照恢复与-backfill-补位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"断线是常态，不是异常","id":"断线是常态-不是异常"},{"level":2,"text":"重连 Token 设计","id":"重连-token-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"与普通 Session Token 的区别","id":"与普通-session-token-的区别"},{"level":3,"text":"重连 Token 的生成","id":"重连-token-的生成"},{"level":3,"text":"重连 Token 发给客户端","id":"重连-token-发给客户端"},{"level":2,"text":"断线检测流程","id":"断线检测流程"},{"level":2,"text":"状态快照恢复流程","id":"状态快照恢复流程"},{"level":3,"text":"增量事件回放","id":"增量事件回放"},{"level":2,"text":"Backfill 补位","id":"backfill-补位"},{"level":3,"text":"使用场景","id":"使用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"Backfill 流程","id":"backfill-流程"},{"level":2,"text":"断线重连完整流程图","id":"断线重连完整流程图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可扩展与分片：一致性哈希、Party Affinity 与水平扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/engineering/scaling-sharding"},"next":{"title":"反滥用与审核：聊天过滤、举报系统与 Ban 传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/engineering/anti-abuse-moderation"}}